{"id":"5f26541d9202f4f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-square.md","title":"$\\square {\\kappa}$ (Square Principle)","display":"thm-square — $\\square_{\\kappa}$ (Square Principle)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-square","aliases":["58-thm-square"],"display":"thm-square — $\\square_{\\kappa}$ (Square Principle)","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-square"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-square</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-square — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\square_{\\kappa}\\)</span> (Square Principle)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c440efb875e77330\" href=\"?note=c440efb875e77330\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\vec C\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\vec C\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c440efb875e77330\" href=\"?note=c440efb875e77330\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md</a>）.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}square}\\vdash\n\\square_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}square}\\vdash\n\\square_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\square_{\\kappa}\\)</span> is tied to the canonical square-sequence predicate, including its exact limit domain, order-type bound, coherence, and no-thread clause.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_{\\omega}\">\\(\\square_{\\omega}\\)</span> holds in ZFC; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\square_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> may fail under large cardinal assumptions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"c440efb875e77330","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"c440efb875e77330","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2$（see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-square-sequence.md]]）.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\square_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\vec C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}square}\\vdash\n\\square_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\square_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\square_{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\square_{\\omega_1}","display":false}],"bytes":847,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","ancho